  "title": "Tread Lightly, and when not to run",
  "intro": "The Corp has ice on HQ. Tread Lightly makes a run during which every rez costs the Corp 3 more — so rezzing Palisade costs them 6, not 3. And once you have passed a piece of ice you may jack out: end the run yourself, keeping your credits and having learned what protects the server.\n\nThis lesson: play Tread Lightly on HQ, break Palisade, then jack out instead of accessing.",
  "outro": "You spent 2 credits; the Corp spent 6 to keep you out of a server you then chose not to enter. You now know HQ is behind a barrier you can break, and the Corp is poorer. Not every run has to end in an access. That is the Runner track: money, breakers, runs, accesses, and choosing your moment. Press Enter to graduate to the starter game.",
